{"products":[{"id":8038489620555,"title":"Mochi Berrier Moisture Cream","handle":"mochi-berrier-moisture-cream","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThis rich, bouncy formula is made from upcycled strawberry stems and leaves—parts typically overlooked as waste—which work to support firmer, smoother, and more radiant-looking skin. Plus, it's non-comedogenic with no greasy feel. Mochi Berrier Moisture Cream is the perfect fit for dry, sensitive, and overworked skin that needs recovery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy is it different:\u003c\/strong\u003e Delivers the plumpness and hydration of a heavy hitter without a greasy feel or fear of clogging pores. You'll feel the hydration the second it touches your skin.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHelps with:\u003c\/strong\u003e Promoting firmer, smoother, and more radiant-looking skin and supporting your skin barrier.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMade for:\u003c\/strong\u003e All skin types, especially sensitive, overworked skin that needs recovery. Formulated to mirror your skin's own barrier so it actually stays.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClinically Proven:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"list-style: disc;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"list-style: disc;\"\u003eMoisturizes skin for up to 48 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"list-style: disc;\"\u003eClinically proven to soothe irritated skin by 19%*\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"list-style: disc;\"\u003eClinically proven to balance skin's oil after 4 weeks*\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"list-style: disc;\"\u003eBased on an independent clinical study on 21 subjects.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBONUS:\u003c\/strong\u003e Packaged in a 100% plastic-free, at-home compostable jar. \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","published_at":"2026-09-15T07:57:08-04:00","create